[[Sophie Casterwill]] took [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Dante Vale]] to stay in her townhouse after they fled from [[Dante's house]] in order to escape [[DeFoe]], [[Grier]], and the [[Suits]]. [[Lok Lambert|Lok]] and [[Dante Vale|Dante]] continued to stay there for some time as Dante's house and [[Lok's dormitory]] were under surveillance by [[the Organization]]. {{source|The Casterwill Client}}

After [[Sophie Casterwill|Sophie]]'s credit card was declined at the [[Marco Polo Airport]], the team gathered at the Casterwill townhouse to find a way to conduct their mission in [[:Category:Egypt|Egypt]]. Lok and Sophie decided to make money with part time jobs to be able to pay the plane tickets and give a salary to [[Dante Vale|Dante]]. After repeated failures, [[Dante Vale|Dante]] joined them at the townhouse and let them know he had gathered money with private detective gigs and had bought plane tickets for all of them. {{source|All Work and No Pay}}

[[Lok Lambert|Lok]] and [[Cherit]] were fencing in the townhouse's China room while [[Sophie Casterwill|Sophie]] was trying to master the spell [[Findshape]]. They ended up breaking a vase which enraged Sophie, and were promptly kicked out of the house. But the event suddenly allowed [[Sophie Casterwill|Sophie]] to master the spell, and she was able to repair both the broken vase and [[Eathon Lambert's journal]]. {{source|The Unseen Guide}}

The team retreated to the townhouse after being severely overpowered by [[The Professor]], his elite [[Suits]] and his legendary titan [[Araknos]] while fighting on the roof of [[Dante Vale's house|Dante's house]]. [[Dante Vale|Dante]] created the diversion to allow them to flee and soon joined them, and while he appeared to be under mind control at first, he quickly reassured them. {{source|The Secret of Two Generations}}

[[LeBlanche]] gave a lecture on Italian painters to [[Sophie Casterwill|Sophie]] and [[Lok Lambert|Lok]] at the townhouse, as their school was still under surveillance by [[The Organization]]. The lecture was interrupted by [[Dante Vale]] to start planning their next mission to find [[Avalon]]. {{source|Cave of the Casterwills}}

The team headed back to the townhouse after [[Sophie Casterwill|Sophie]] successfully bonded with [[Phoenix]], the legendary Titan of Immortality. [[Lok Lambert|Lok]] and [[Sophie Casterwill|Sophie]] then had a conversation on the balcony about Sophie's responsibilities as the new leader of the [[Casterwill family]]. {{source|Cave of the Casterwills}}

